# The 139 rigged hero models. ~1.1 GB total, ~8 MB each — individually well
# under GitHub's 100 MB file limit, but far too much to put in plain git, where
# every byte of every revision lives in the pack forever.
#
# ONLY the .glb are tracked. The PNGs and .import sidecars that appear next to
# them are GENERATED by Godot's glTF importer (it extracts the embedded
# textures on first import), so they are gitignored and regenerated by
# `godot --headless --path . --import`. Committing them would add ~171 MB of
# derived data that drifts out of step with the models it came from.
assets/heroes/animated/*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Godot text resources are text; keep diffs readable and line endings stable.
*.gd      text eol=lf
*.tscn    text eol=lf
*.tres    text eol=lf
*.godot   text eol=lf
*.cfg     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
